course: dictionary
lesson: 8555
title: Words that tell you where
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words tell you where something comes from. Look at the words next to them to find out what they mean. «An old Scandinavian folk story said lemmings fell from the sky.» The word Scandinavian comes right before «folk story», so it tells you where the story is from.
explain: Scandinavian means from or to do with Norway, Sweden and Denmark. Often Finland and Iceland are included too. A Scandinavian is a person from Scandinavia. Read the sentence and ask: what does this word describe?
explain: «Scandinavian design» means simple, light furniture. Here the word describes a style, not a person. When a word is new, try swapping in your meaning. Does the sentence still make sense?
fact: Scandinavian means from or to do with Norway, Sweden and Denmark, and often Finland and Iceland.
fact: A Scandinavian is a person from Scandinavia.
fact: «Scandinavian design» means simple, light furniture.
fact: «Scandinavian languages» are languages spoken in Scandinavia, such as Swedish.
exercise: Which country is in Scandinavia? | Italy | *Norway | Greece | Spain
exercise: «She bought a Scandinavian design chair.» What does Scandinavian tell you about the chair? | It is very old and broken | It can fly | It is made of gold | *It is in the Scandinavian style, simple and light
exercise: What is a Scandinavian? | A person who lives in a desert | *A person from Norway, Sweden or Denmark | A person who never leaves home | A kind of cold weather
test: «An old Scandinavian folk story said lemmings fell from the sky.» What does Scandinavian describe in this sentence? | The storms | *The folk story, which came from Scandinavia | The sky | The lemmings
test: Which of these is a Scandinavian language? | Spanish | *Swedish | Swahili | Japanese
exam: «The chronicle says Varangian (Scandinavian) leaders such as Oleh came to rule Kyiv.» What does the word in brackets tell you? | What the leaders ate for dinner | *Where the Varangian leaders came from | How tall the leaders were | How many years they ruled
